    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061109.0107\n\nJAKARTA, Nov. 9 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nIndonesian shares close higher\n\n\n\n\nShare prices on the Jakarta Stock Exchange ended higher Thursday led by gains in banking shares.\n\nThe composite index rose by 14.2 points to close at 1,660.26 points.\n\nTurnovers totaled 1.5 billion shares worth 1.85 trillion rupiah (203.1 million U.S. dollars).\n\nAdvancers beat decliners 69 to 40, with 83 other issues left unchanged.",
